WEBVTT

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:56.420
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, things were looking up.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.000
With Piccolo keeping Frieza busy, Goku was able to complete his

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.820
his ultimate weapon, the Spirit Bomb.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.080
Drawing energy from all living things,

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.880
it was an attack not even Frieza could ignore.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.670
- No, that's impossible!

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.690
- The awesome power of the Spirit Bomb

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.550
seemed too much for him to handle,

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:22.390
as he struggled to hold it back.

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.030
It was a tense moment indeed on Planet Namek,

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:28.260
as the hopes of our heroes were riding on this one attack.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:35.060
Has Goku finally conquered the vicious tyrant of space?

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:41.460
Will the universe once again be safe from Frieza's greedy claws?

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.650
Stay tuned to find out today!

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:25.990
You think that's the end of Frieza?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:29.700
I hope so.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:35.550
- But where's my daddy?

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.330
He was pretty close to the blast when it went off.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:41.840
So maybe he, maybe he was too close.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:52.860
- Hey, don't worry.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:58.070
- But I can't feel his, his presence.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.000
- That's because you're not concentrating

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:09.740
Hard enough on it go on and besides he was with piccolo they're both all right

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.100
Look what is that over there?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.160
Gigalo!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:04.490
It's my dad. He's alive. Yeah!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.490
Well, Gohan, what are you waiting for?

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:19.830
Oh, man. It's hard to fly because we used up most of our energy against Frieza.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:28.840
Piccolo! Dad! Dad! Piccolo!

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:58.320
Okay?

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:07.430
- Hey, Piccolo.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.260
- Yes?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.410
- Uh, nothing.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:28.110
- Sorry to make you worry.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.060
- Uh, no.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.090
Your spirit bomb was just awesome!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.190
It was so huge!

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:39.110
That's because it was filled with the energy of every living creature in the solar system.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:43.090
I gotta admit, I thought that I'd never see you again.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:47.190
Surely you must have had more faith in your father than that.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.760
I guess now we can all get back down to Earth.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.550
For a while there, I didn't think we'd get back.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:56.290
Huh?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.000
What I meant was it's...

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.730
Not that I didn't have faith in Goku.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.010
It's just, I'm homesick.

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.370
- Huh?

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.560
- Huh?

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:11.080
- Uh.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:25.050
- Goku has done it!

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:27.470
He's finding the freedom freezer!

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.800
Woohoo!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.000
Oh, happy day!

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:36.420
What are you talking about you old kook no one can defeat Frieza

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:44.280
Impossible no way you sure

00:07:50.120 --> 00:08:00.000
If Goku's one then so have we and that means if Piccolo's alive then we can get ourselves back to Earth

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.300
Yeah!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:37.770
Now you've done it!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.940
Purple Comet Attack!

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.900
Comet Flash Attack!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.850
What was that?

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:36.190
Eugh...

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:37.520
Eugh...

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.500
Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.070
and he's down for the count.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:05.730
BOOOOOO!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:13.770
I hate it when they start to belly flop!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:17.770
HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:23.550
Uh... Uh... Chase? Uh... Uh... Bertha?

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:27.530
Berthu? A- AAAAAAAH!

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:29.190
*BOOM*

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:46.690
Just wait till I get out of here!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:53.880
Jake, you're leaving. You've got another thing coming because it's not so easy to get out of this place.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:59.760
We'll see about that!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.470
Oh!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:49.270
You're trading paid off handsomely you even surprised me with some of your techniques

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:57.590
When I invited the game you force here. I never thought you'd beat them. You invited those guys

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.000
What I

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:06.120
What I wanted to say was that the Gingu Force showing up here was as much of a surprise for me, too.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.660
I mean, it's not like I brought them here to help train you or anything.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.660
What a silly thought.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:15.010
So why don't we just forget about them, shall we?

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:19.930
Good job, man! Good job! Woo-hoo!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:24.390
You know, I'll bet you three are glad I didn't invite Frieza himself here, aren't you?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:28.520
Get it? It's a joke!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:57.940
Haha.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:09.590
Well, guys, if we leave right now, it'll take us just about five days to get home.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.120
Yay! I can see my mom again!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.290
I'll see all my friends!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:34.670
We forgot about Bulma. What are we going to do?

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:40.530
Don't scare me like that, Krillin. For a second, I thought you saw Frieza again.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:46.360
In some ways, Bulma's worse than Frieza. At least that's how I feel.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:59.630
Ooh, don't make me laugh, Krillin. I still ache all over.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:10.350
Well, it looks like we were too late to save the planet Namek.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:16.810
I just hope Guru and all of his loyal followers who were destroyed can now rest in peace.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:18.900
Huh?

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:19.900
What?

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:30.000
How in the world do you know about Guru, Piccolo?

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:54.580
what is it krillin

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:30.000
direct hit with your spirit bomb and no one could survive that

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:35.250
Let's go.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:42.530
No, how could he?

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.970
Hey, King Kai, what is it?

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.000
Poor picture.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:08.610
Piccolo, poor, poor Piccolo, but I thought you said Goku defeated Frieza.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:16.060
It's all my fault, I was foolish to think Frieza could be defeated, and he's more horrible

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:27.010
than I ever imagined.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:33.050
Piccolo? Eh? Piccolo!

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.750
Freeze!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.290
Ahhhh!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:47.730
I must admit that spirit bomb of yours sure packs a wallop.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:50.710
It even knocked the breath out of me.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.720
Gohan!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:02.840
Krillin!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.990
Listen up!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.190
Huh?

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:10.180
The spaceship I used to get to this planet shouldn't be too far from here.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:16.620
Find Bulmin the ship and then get as far away from here as you can.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.620
Come on!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:18.600
What are you waiting for?

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.970
I'm not going!

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:24.170
I'd never let you fight Frieza alone!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.670
Listen, Gohan!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.340
You have to get out of here now!

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:30.000
You don't have a say in the matter!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:32.200
We can't leave.

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:36.730
If you think that your little friends can escape me, you're sadly mistaken.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.410
Look out!

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.680
This time you won't come back.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.920
Krillin, no!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.670
Oh, Krillin!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.100
Razor, stop this!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:26.530
It was quick.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:53.600
I won't let you get away with this!

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.150
I won't let you!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.360
Listen very carefully.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.000
You must leave this planet

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:38.190
it now and take piccolo with you got it this is the last time I'm going to tell

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:42.070
you get out of here right now gohan

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:08.320
Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:22.270
Has Frieza pushed Goku's rage to new heights?

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:25.670
And can Goku avenge the life of his close friend Krillin?

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:29.700
The only way to find out is to watch the next exciting episode.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:32.470
of Dragon Ball Z.
